{title: Jesus Loves the Little Children}
{artist: C. Herbert Woolston}
{genre: Children}
{style: Traditional}
{flow: Opening}
{key: C}
{tempo: 92}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Jesus loves the little children
All the children of the [G]world
[C]Red and yellow, black and white
They are [F]precious in His [C]sight
[C]Jesus loves the [G]little [C]children of the world
{end_of_verse}
